/target
Cargo.lock.orig
*.swp
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.vak/sessions/
dist/
# Admin SPA: built assets ARE committed so `cargo build` needs no node.
!crates/vak-admin-ui/dist/
# Workspace client, web build: embedded into vak-server under /app, so it is
# committed for the same reason — a headless box builds the server without
# node. The Tauri build (crates/vak-client-ui/dist/) stays ignored: only
# vak-desktop ships it, and building the desktop already needs npm.
!crates/vak-client-ui/dist-web/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
# tools belong in the session cwd

# Claude Code session/worktree artifacts — never project content.
.claude/
# Poolside agent harness scratch (runtime settings, scratch, etc.) — never project content.
.poolside/
